# Title: Suspicious Eventlog Clearing or Configuration Change Activity
# ID: cc36992a-4671-4f21-a91d-6c2b72a2edf5
# Status: stable
# Level: high
# Author: Ecco, Daniil Yugoslavskiy, oscd.community, D3F7A5105, Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2019-09-26
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685.005, attack.t1685.001, car.2016-04-002
# Description: Detects the clearing or configuration tampering of EventLog using utilities such as "wevtutil", "powershell" and "wmic".
# This technique were seen used by threat actors and ransomware strains in order to evade defenses.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((((process.command_line:*clear-log * OR process.command_line:* cl * OR process.command_line:*set-log * OR process.command_line:* sl * OR process.command_line:*lfn:*)) AND ((process.executable:*\\wevtutil.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"wevtutil.exe"))) OR ((((process.command_line:*Clear-EventLog * OR process.command_line:*Remove-EventLog * OR process.command_line:*Limit-EventLog * OR process.command_line:*Clear-WinEvent *)) OR ((process.command_line:*Eventing.Reader.EventLogSession* AND process.command_line:*ClearLog*)) OR ((process.command_line:*Diagnostics.EventLog* AND process.command_line:*Clear*))) AND ((process.executable:*\\powershell.exe OR process.executable:*\\powershell_ise.exe OR process.executable:*\\pwsh.exe))) OR ((process.executable:*\\powershell.exe OR process.executable:*\\powershell_ise.exe OR process.executable:*\\pwsh.exe OR process.executable:*\\wmic.exe) AND process.command_line:*ClearEventLog*)) AND NOT (((process.parent.executable:"C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\msiexec.exe" OR process.parent.executable:"C:\\Windows\\System32\\msiexec.exe") AND process.command_line:* sl *)))
